{"id":"1c58d8be3b47a5f9","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-zfc-largecard2-strong-cardinal.md","title":"ZFC Largecard2 Strong Cardinal","display":"df-zfc-largecard2-strong-cardinal — ZFC Largecard2 Strong Cardinal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-largecard2-strong-cardinal","aliases":["58-df-zfc-largecard2-strong-cardinal","58-df-zfc-largecard3-strong-cardinal"],"display":"df-zfc-largecard2-strong-cardinal — ZFC Largecard2 Strong Cardinal","depends_on":["[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-largecard4-n-huge-cardinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-largecard2-strong-cardinal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-largecard2-strong-cardinal</span><span>58-df-zfc-largecard3-strong-cardinal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-largecard2-strong-cardinal — ZFC Largecard2 Strong Cardinal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"38339d60720b0f2a\" href=\"?note=38339d60720b0f2a\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-zfc-largecard4-n-huge-cardinal.md\">../batch01/58-df-zfc-largecard4-n-huge-cardinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> (cardinal candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\\in\\operatorname{Ord}\">\\(\\lambda\\in\\operatorname{Ord}\\)</span> (rank bound)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> (transitive class)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j:V\\to M\">\\(j:V\\to M\\)</span> (class elementary embedding in the ambient class metatheory)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{class}\">\\(\\mathrm{class}\\)</span> (sort marker on the metatheoretic quantifier <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists^{\\mathrm{class}}\">\\(\\exists^{\\mathrm{class}}\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\)</span> (cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClassElemEmb}_S(j,M)\">\\(\\mathrm{ClassElemEmb}_S(j,M)\\)</span> (class elementary embedding <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j:V\\to M\">\\(j:V\\to M\\)</span> with transitive target, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"38339d60720b0f2a\" href=\"?note=38339d60720b0f2a\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-zfc-largecard4-n-huge-cardinal.md\">../batch01/58-df-zfc-largecard4-n-huge-cardinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{StrongCardinal}\">\\(\\operatorname{StrongCardinal}\\)</span> (predicate defined below)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}largecard2\\text{-}strong\\text{-}cardinal} \\vdash \\operatorname{StrongCardinal}(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in\\operatorname{Ord}\\;\\Bigl(\\kappa&lt;\\lambda\\to\\exists^{\\mathrm{class}}M,j\\;(\\mathrm{ClassElemEmb}_S(j,M)\\land\\operatorname{crit}(j)=\\kappa\\land\\lambda&lt;j(\\kappa)\\land V_\\lambda\\subseteq M)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}largecard2\\text{-}strong\\text{-}cardinal} \\vdash \\operatorname{StrongCardinal}(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in\\operatorname{Ord}\\;\\Bigl(\\kappa&lt;\\lambda\\to\\exists^{\\mathrm{class}}M,j\\;(\\mathrm{ClassElemEmb}_S(j,M)\\land\\operatorname{crit}(j)=\\kappa\\land\\lambda&lt;j(\\kappa)\\land V_\\lambda\\subseteq M)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The quantifier ranges over ordinal rank bounds, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j(\\kappa)&gt;\\lambda\">\\(j(\\kappa)&gt;\\lambda\\)</span> is stated explicitly.</li>\n<li>Quantification over <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> is in the ambient class metatheory; the registered two-argument class-embedding predicate already fixes the domain as <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>, so no spurious third argument is supplied.</li>\n<li>The alias <code>58-df-zfc-largecard3-strong-cardinal</code> denotes this same definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-zfc-largecard4-n-huge-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"38339d60720b0f2a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-largecard4-n-huge-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)$ (cardinal predicate, see [[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-zfc-largecard4-n-huge-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"38339d60720b0f2a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ClassElemEmb}_S(j,M)$ (class elementary embedding $j:V\\to M$ with transitive target, see [[../batch01/58-df-zfc-largecard4-n-huge-cardinal.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda\\in\\operatorname{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"j:V\\to M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{class}","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists^{\\mathrm{class}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ClassElemEmb}_S(j,M)","display":false},{"tex":"j:V\\to M","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{StrongCardinal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}largecard2\\text{-}strong\\text{-}cardinal} \\vdash \\operatorname{StrongCardinal}(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in\\operatorname{Ord}\\;\\Bigl(\\kappa<\\lambda\\to\\exists^{\\mathrm{class}}M,j\\;(\\mathrm{ClassElemEmb}_S(j,M)\\land\\operatorname{crit}(j)=\\kappa\\land\\lambda<j(\\kappa)\\land V_\\lambda\\subseteq M)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"j(\\kappa)>\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"j","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false}],"bytes":1836,"backlinks":[{"id":"b1b421c8b0b990ce","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ClassElemEmb}_S(j,M)$（定义域为 $V$、目标为传递类 $M$ 的类初等嵌入谓词，见 [[../batch07/58-df-zfc-largecard2-strong-cardinal.md]]）"},{"id":"66e7bdc463325f8b","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{StrongCardinal}$ is the class-metatheoretic strong-cardinal predicate from [[../batch07/58-df-zfc-largecard2-strong-cardinal.md]]."},{"id":"1200b42abaf85b5e","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · d